# graphify - devWiki knowledge graph (./dev.py graph ...). It scans the repository root,
# filtered by /.graphifyignore, and writes to LibreFolio_devWiki/graphify-out/.
# Tracked: GRAPH_REPORT.md, manifest.json (repo-relative keys), cost.json.
LibreFolio_devWiki/graphify-out/graph.json
LibreFolio_devWiki/graphify-out/graph.html
LibreFolio_devWiki/graphify-out/.graphify_*
# Per-machine caches: stat index (mtimes/inodes), AST and semantic extraction caches.
LibreFolio_devWiki/graphify-out/cache/
LibreFolio_devWiki/graphify-out/converted/
# graphify's own dated backup of the previous outputs, written by each rebuild
LibreFolio_devWiki/graphify-out/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]*/

# Stray debug artifacts (e.g. saved error pages from failed chart/screenshot runs)
